{"id":2301,"name":"西红柿豆腐汤羹","image":"/images/dishes/htc-2301.jpg","category":"素菜","taste":"清淡","cookingMethod":"炖煮","difficulty":"简单","cookingTime":"15分钟","servings":"每份：","ingredients":["西红柿","鸡蛋","豆腐","食用油","盐","淀粉","鸡精","香葱","姜","开水"],"preparation":["西红柿 1 个","鸡蛋 1 个","豆腐 100 g","食用油 5 ml","盐 2 g","淀粉 5 g","鸡精 2 g","香葱 0.5 根","姜 1 片","开水 350 ml"],"steps":["西红柿切成小丁、鸡蛋打入碗中搅拌、豆腐切块备用","起锅烧油，放入姜片 5 S 后倒入入西红柿翻炒 30 S","锅中加入开水，汤水烧开，60 S 后到入鸡蛋液、豆腐块","汤水重新烧开后，加入水淀粉，沿一个方向搅拌 2 圈","加入鸡精、盐、香葱，30 S 后起锅"],"nutrition":{"calories":"242 大卡"},"videoTutorials":{"platforms":[{"key":"bilibili","name":"哔哩哔哩","searchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=%E8%A5%BF%E7%BA%A2%E6%9F%BF%E8%B1%86%E8%85%90%E6%B1%A4%E7%BE%B9%20%E5%AE%B6%E5%B8%B8%E5%81%9A%E6%B3%95%20%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B"},{"key":"douyin","name":"抖音","searchUrl":"https://www.douyin.com/search/%E8%A5%BF%E7%BA%A2%E6%9F%BF%E8%B1%86%E8%85%90%E6%B1%A4%E7%BE%B9%20%E5%AE%B6%E5%B8%B8%E5%81%9A%E6%B3%95%20%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B?type=video"}]},"source":{"name":"HowToCook","repository":"Anduin2017/HowToCook","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/c694a5c457d45e6e012ae6cd9a7724aab86e320b/dishes/vegetable_dish/%E8%A5%BF%E7%BA%A2%E6%9F%BF%E8%B1%86%E8%85%90%E6%B1%A4%E7%BE%B9/%E8%A5%BF%E7%BA%A2%E6%9F%BF%E8%B1%86%E8%85%90%E6%B1%A4%E7%BE%B9.md"}}
